{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-factoryFixer11b-11071": "MAN: 炸弹还没落下来，要修的地方就够多了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-factoryFixer11a-11072": "MAN: 不知道他在抱怨什么，照这样下去，我们永远不愁没活干。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-factoryYW11-11073": "WOMAN: 我以前给一位有身份的夫人当女仆，所以他们让我从瓦砾里挑出值钱的东西。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-factoryRubble1-11074": "MAN: 放火烧了整座城还不够，连大家的东西都要偷？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-factoryRubble2-11075": "MAN: 不，我们可不是偷，东西会还给失主，只收点报酬……前提是有人来认领。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-factoryLunch11d-11076": "OFFICER: 哦，这么快就恢复老样子了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-factoryLunch11c-11077": "MAN: 我最后记得的，就是一声枪响，接着便一头栽在石板路上。不知过了多久，我居然又站起来了，眼前全是那些光柱。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-factoryLunch11c-11078": "MAN: 你说神不神？这一来，连我的老膝盖都好了，耳朵也重新听得清了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-factoryLunch11b-11079": "MAN: 真没想到，死了又活过来的反而走运。我醒来还是咳得要命，浑身硬得像木板，偏偏该硬的地方不硬。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-factoryLunch11a-11080": "MAN: 我下了夜班就睡了，一觉醒来，房顶居然多了个洞，可我愣是一点动静都没听见。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-factoryLunch11a-11081": "MAN: 也不知道是炸弹砸中了我，那道光又把我救活了，还是炸弹压根就没伤着我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-factoryLunchLady-11082": "WOMAN: 我丈夫还没法回来干活，这阵子就由我替他上班。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-factoryLunchLady-11083": "WOMAN: 那些光柱能让死人活过来，可人要是只断了胳膊或腿，却一点用也没有。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-southBeacher1-11084": "EXPLORER: 你们好，我们正准备收拾营地离开，这里没什么可看的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-southBeacher1-11085": "EXPLORER: 刚才那艘飞空艇要是你们的，不妨沿着海岸一路找过去，从空中看看能发现些什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-southBeacher2-11086": "ARCHAEOLOGIST: 嗯？哦，我们在勘测这一带的海岸。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-southBeacher2-11087": "ARCHAEOLOGIST: 希纳尔时代的古地图上，海岸线跟现在很不一样，就连后来埃特伦帝国的地图也是如此。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-southBeacher2-11088": "ARCHAEOLOGIST: 这两个国家当年都有不少城市建在沿海，这倒不奇怪。问题是，如今的海岸已经不在原来的位置了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-southBeacher2-11089": "ARCHAEOLOGIST: 所以古物部让我们做一次全面勘测，等条件允许，就能拿这些资料与其他世界交流。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-southBeacher2-11090": "ARCHAEOLOGIST: 换到海岸更干燥或更湿润的世界，有些古城也许反而更容易抵达。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-southBeacher3-11091": "CARTOGRAPHER: 我们已经发现，在好几个世界里，王家档案馆和希尔德里克之井都位于完全相同的位置。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-southBeacher3-11092": "CARTOGRAPHER: 因此我们目前有个推测：不同世界之间，唯独希纳尔遗迹的位置保持不变。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-southBeacher3-11093": "CARTOGRAPHER: 至于为什么会这样，我实在想不通，可眼前的证据确实如此。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-southBeacher3-11094": "CARTOGRAPHER: 不管怎样，要找尚未被发现的希纳尔遗迹，最有希望的地方是大陆边缘，那里离“风暴与黑暗”事件发生的地方最远。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-desertParty1-11095": "DARIO: 就是听了你们带来的四个世界的消息，我们才大老远跑到这里来考察。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-desertParty1-11096": "DARIO: 可惜到现在也没什么收获。法师们说，魔力几乎飘不到这一带，大概跟这里很少下雨是同一个原因。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-desertParty1-11097": "DARIO: 公会原本还以为，这一趟总能找到点什么呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-desertParty2-11098": "GUILD MAGE: 皮埃尔·勒德尼耶当年穿过一件魔法很强的斗篷——先说清楚，是土系魔法，跟那边那个部族玩意儿可不是一回事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-desertParty2-11099": "GUILD MAGE: 那件斗篷其实是一件传承下来的古代遗物。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-desertParty2-11100": "GUILD MAGE: 它在世界分裂之前就已经存在了，所以我们才想来看看，在这里能不能找到它的踪影。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-desertParty2-11101": "GUILD MAGE: 不过，假如它还在另一边的那座城里，如今恐怕已经无从找起了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-desertParty2-11102": "GUILD MAGE: 据我们所知，皮埃尔没有继承人。斗篷也许还留在他的旧宅里……前提是那房子还在。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-desertParty3-11103": "CARAVANER: 地标我倒都认得，可连一个牛角面包都找不着。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-desertParty4-11104": "GUIDE: 至少这趟报酬不错，东南那座城里的人平常可抠门了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-desertParty5-11105": "GUIDE: 他们想知道这里是什么情况，先来问问我们不就好了？水井干涸以前，还有部族到这里做买卖呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/c11leorniaNPCs.yarn-desertParty5-11106": "GUIDE: 可惜啊，城里人从来就不肯信我们说的话。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-outpostShop-11107": "DEALER: 想看看我的稀罕货吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildNaturalist-11108": "NATURALIST: 我在研究那些已经不见踪影的魔法生物，想听听我查到了些什么吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildNaturalist-11109": "奇美拉圣祠",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildNaturalist-11110": "NATURALIST: 传说在遥远的东北方，有一座失落的希纳尔圣祠。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildNaturalist-11111": "NATURALIST: 据说希纳尔人曾在那里把人变成魔法生物，至于为什么要这么做，我就想不通了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildNaturalist-11112": "NATURALIST: 不过，我敢说那座圣祠不在这个世界，已经有船从那一带驶过，根本没见到它的踪影。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildNaturalist-11113": "那只……鸭狗一样的东西……去哪儿了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildNaturalist-11114": "NATURALIST: 从你们带来的东西判断，那家伙吃了大量垃圾，显然是便秘了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildNaturalist-11115": "NATURALIST: 接下来，它大概会找一片广阔的草地，清一清肠胃。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildNaturalist-11116": "NATURALIST: 看来它喜欢上了吃那些在崖壁筑巢的鸟，可能会往山口迁移。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildNaturalist-11117": "NATURALIST: 看来那家伙最近爱上吃松露了。你们不妨去温暖潮湿的沼泽或湿地找找。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildNaturalist-11118": "NATURALIST: 这类四处迁徙的生物生病时，有时会找苦水喝。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildNaturalist-11119": "NATURALIST: 你们可以去沙漠里找找，尤其是有峡谷的地方。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildNaturalist-11120": "哪里有世上最凶猛的生物？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildNaturalist-11121": "NATURALIST: 照理说，龙早在五百年前就被猎杀殆尽了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildNaturalist-11122": "NATURALIST: 可我的前辈们在记载中，依然提到东北荒野有一处“龙池”。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildNaturalist-11123": "没什么",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildGeographer-11124": "GEOGRAPHER: 自从得知还有另外三个世界，我就开始翻查古地图，寻找那些早已不见踪影的地方。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildGeographer-11125": "GEOGRAPHER: 你们想了解哪一处？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildGeographer-11126": "地之圣祠",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildGeographer-11127": "GEOGRAPHER: 地之圣祠啊，有一段残存的希纳尔铭文提到，它位于里恩境内。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildGeographer-11128": "GEOGRAPHER: 要我猜的话，入口应该就在山脉附近的一片崎岖高原上。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildGeographer-11129": "失落的伊纳神殿",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildGeographer-11130": "GEOGRAPHER: 失落的伊纳神殿啊……嗯，莱奥尼亚境内已经一座都不剩了。斯特拉尔倒是有一座，可那也算不上“失落”。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildGeographer-11131": "GEOGRAPHER: 至于堤刻半岛，我也没听说过哪里有。不过，就算排除这些地方，仍有大片地区可以找。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildGeographer-11132": "阿斯库扎雅营地",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildGeographer-11133": "GEOGRAPHER: 阿斯库扎雅部族？他们的狩猎范围相当广，说杰兰德语的游牧部族大多是这样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildGeographer-11134": "GEOGRAPHER: 地点不好说，但我知道他们以作战凶猛、武艺高强著称，击败对手靠的是这些本事，而不是魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildGeographer-11135": "没什么",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildMaster-11136": "GUILD MASTER: 欢迎来到探险家公会！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildMaster-11137": "GUILD MASTER: 想必听说另外三个世界的事了吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildMaster-11138": "NIKOLAI: 呵，是啊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildMaster-11139": "ZIKARON: 呵，是啊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildMaster-11140": "JUNA: 看看我就知道了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildMaster-11141": "BEN: 那可不。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildMaster-11142": "AGATA: 是的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildMaster-11143": "ALEXANDRA: 呃，说来有趣……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildMaster-11144": "JEROME: 可以这么说。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildMaster-11145": "CORDELIA: 正是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildMaster-11146": "GUILD MASTER: 为此，议会已经授权我们展开探索，尽可能寻找新的发现。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildMaster-11147": "GUILD MASTER: 不管是其他世界的痕迹，还是遗留下来的东西，都在我们的搜寻范围内。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildMaster-11148": "GUILD MASTER: 如果你们愿意帮忙，不妨跟公会的几位专家聊聊，他们手里有不少有用的线索。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildMaster-11149": "GUILD MASTER: 如果你们愿意帮忙，不妨跟公会的几位专家聊聊，他们手里有不少有用的线索。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildArchivist-11150": "ARCHIVIST: 我负责搜寻失落的古代器物，你们想了解哪一件？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildArchivist-11151": "ARCHIVIST: 全找到了？天哪，你们这是要让我没活干啊！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildArchivist-11152": "失落的杜兰达尔",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildArchivist-11153": "ARCHIVIST: 杜兰达尔是龙塞沃家的传家宝，一柄魔法剑，在科尔辛战争期间遗失了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildArchivist-11154": "ARCHIVIST: 当时，龙塞沃家的一位后裔是名上尉，在尼巴罗斯山东南方的一座古修道院附近遭到伏击，随后便下落不明。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildArchivist-11155": "破龙者",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildArchivist-11156": "ARCHIVIST: 六百年前，莱奥尼亚国王向雷兹公爵借了一柄传奇长矛，用来对付一条龙。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildArchivist-11157": "ARCHIVIST: 可惜运送它的船没能抵达，沉在了东海的某处。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildArchivist-11158": "大和",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildArchivist-11159": "ARCHIVIST: 奥斯伦有个传说，讲的是一位来自世界边缘之外的剑士。我之所以留意这个故事，是因为他那把剑。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildArchivist-11160": "ARCHIVIST: 据说他沿着海岸游历，决斗屡战屡胜，最后却被一位只使长棍的僧人打落了兵器。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildArchivist-11161": "ARCHIVIST: 记载提到他最后正沿着海岸往西北方的塞伦走，再后来就没有他的消息了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-guildArchivist-11162": "没什么",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-neal-11163": "POQUE: 幸好我及时离开了莱奥尼亚，才躲过一劫。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-neal-11164": "POQUE: 到这里一看，地方虽小，倒也很适合做我的生意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-neal-11165": "POQUE: 那么，有什么需要我帮忙的吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-neal-11166": "还剩多少人物任务？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-neal-11167": "POQUE: 还有 {0} 个未完成的人物任务！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-neal-11168": "POQUE: 还有 {0} 个未完成的人物任务！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-neal-11169": "POQUE: 所有人物任务都完成了，干得好！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-neal-11170": "选择战斗音乐",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-neal-11171": "原版战斗音乐（第 1–7 章）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-neal-11172": "战斗音乐 2（第 8–11 章）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-neal-11173": "不用了，谢谢！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-neal2-11174": "POQUE: 这城镇果然如传闻般气派……也许气派过头了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-neal2-11175": "POQUE: 小姐，刚才可真热闹。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMaster-11176": "CARD MASTER: 阿尔卡那牌找得怎么样了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMaster-11177": "还有多少阿尔卡那牌手？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMaster-11178": "CARD MASTER: 七位阿尔卡那持有者，你已击败 {0} 位。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMaster-11179": "CARD MASTER: 七位阿尔卡那持有者，你已击败 {0} 位，继续加油。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMaster-11180": "CARD MASTER: 不可思议……剩下的阿尔卡那牌，你全找到了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMaster-11181": "CARD MASTER: 按照约定，这点心意送给你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMaster-11182": "获得终极圣灵药！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMaster-11183": "CARD MASTER: 最后，再让我强化你用作武器的那副牌，聊表谢意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMaster-11184": "CARD MASTER: 得先卸下那副牌，我才能施法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMaster-11185": "神谕牌蜕变了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMaster-11186": "CARD MASTER: 七位阿尔卡那持有者，你已击败 {0} 位，继续加油。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMaster-11187": "哪里能找到阿尔卡那牌手？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMaster-11188": "CARD MASTER: 有一张在赌博中输给了南方城市的一位家庭主妇，那座城叫阿尔科斯，还是什么来着。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMaster-11189": "CARD MASTER: 有一张在莱奥尼亚的拍卖会上，被富有人家买走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMaster-11190": "CARD MASTER: 有一副在劫掠中落入阿斯库扎雅部族手里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMaster-11191": "CARD MASTER: 有一张曾属于某座温泉镇的一任镇长。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMaster-11192": "CARD MASTER: （至于后来传到了他的哪位后人手里，谁知道呢。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMaster-11193": "CARD MASTER: 有一张属于一群缄默的修士。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMaster-11194": "CARD MASTER: 费奥兰的一名法官应该也有一张，可他突然去世了，现在牌在谁手里就难说了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMaster-11195": "CARD MASTER: 东方一个伊纳家族曾有一张，至于传到了哪位后人手里，也许永远无从得知。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMaster-11196": "CARD MASTER: 等等，你的飞空艇上有位伊纳学者同行？何不直接问问他？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMasterIntro-11197": "CARD MASTER: 看来你手上有一副真正的神谕牌，这可真是难得一见。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMasterIntro-11198": "CARD MASTER: 据说，当年埃特伦人重新发现魔法，神谕牌在其中起了关键作用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMasterIntro-11199": "CARD MASTER: 那时人类还没重新学会直接施法，却已经能借助神谕牌，通过仪式运用魔法了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMasterIntro-11200": "CARD MASTER: 最早的那些牌，大多毁于大图书馆的火灾。不过，其中有些牌附着更强的魔法，表面还镀了一层金属。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMasterIntro-11201": "CARD MASTER: 这些就是阿尔卡那牌。倘若有人能把它们全找出来……倒不必据为己有，只要找到持牌人，再跟他们打上一局并获胜。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-cardMasterIntro-11202": "CARD MASTER: 嗯……真有人办得到的话，我认识的许多人都会很想看看，接下来会发生什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-midasGloveGuy-11203": "TRAVELING SALESMAN: 一看就是冒险家！我这儿有件独一无二的好东西。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-midasGloveGuy-11204": "TRAVELING SALESMAN: 迈达斯手套！让你每场战斗都赚更多瓦尔，每一场哦！叮当，钱来啦！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-midasGloveGuy-11205": "TRAVELING SALESMAN: 别处绝对买不到！十二万五千瓦尔。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-midasGloveGuy-11206": "成交！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-midasGloveGuy-11207": "获得迈达斯手套！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-midasGloveGuy-11208": "TRAVELING SALESMAN: 哎呀！钱不够，手头宽裕了再来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-midasGloveGuy-11209": "不用了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-midasGloveGuy-11210": "TRAVELING SALESMAN: 你可不知道错过了什么……！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/outpostNpcs.yarn-midasGloveGuy-11211": "TRAVELING SALESMAN: 戴上它，去杀怪就行！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrinePuzzles.yarn-earthShrinePuzzle1_init-11212": "ALEXANDRA: 这是……我的记忆？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrinePuzzles.yarn-earthShrinePuzzle1_init-11213": "ALEXANDRA: 不……稍微有些不一样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrinePuzzles.yarn-earthShrinePuzzle1_init-11214": "CORDELIA: 无论如何，看起来像某种考验。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrinePuzzles.yarn-earthShrinePuzzle1_init-11215": "ALEXANDRA: 那就推箱子吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrinePuzzles.yarn-earthShrinePuzzle1_init-11216": "按“\\[party\\]”重试或退出",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrinePuzzles.yarn-earthShrinePuzzle1Reset-11217": "要重置谜题，还是返回上一层？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrinePuzzles.yarn-earthShrinePuzzle1Reset-11218": "重置谜题",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrinePuzzles.yarn-earthShrinePuzzle1Reset-11219": "返回上一层",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrinePuzzles.yarn-earthShrinePuzzle1Reset-11220": "开发者解说",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrinePuzzles.yarn-earthShrinePuzzle1Reset-11221": "不做操作",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrinePuzzles.yarn-earthShrinePuzzle2_init-11222": "按“\\[party\\]”重试或退出",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrinePuzzles.yarn-earthShrinePuzzle2reset-11223": "要重置谜题，还是返回上一层？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrinePuzzles.yarn-earthShrinePuzzle2reset-11224": "重置谜题",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrinePuzzles.yarn-earthShrinePuzzle2reset-11225": "返回上一层",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrinePuzzles.yarn-earthShrinePuzzle2reset-11226": "开发者解说",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrinePuzzles.yarn-earthShrinePuzzle2reset-11227": "不做操作",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-earthShrineOpening-11228": "AGATA: 这里是什么地方？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-earthShrineOpening-11229": "CORDELIA: 魔力满溢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-earthShrineOpening-11230": "JEROME: 你怎么知道？这不是水魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-earthShrineOpening-11231": "CORDELIA: 看那些沙尘，它们在向上……飘落，更别说四处都在震动。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-earthShrineOpening-11232": "JUNA: 我感觉不到魔力……可浓得连气味都闻得见。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-earthShrineOpening-11233": "ALEXANDRA: 是土系魔法，可很奇怪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-earthShrineOpening-11234": "CORDELIA: 怎么奇怪？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-earthShrineOpening-11235": "ALEXANDRA: 嗯……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-earthShrineOpening-11236": "ALEXANDRA: 平常施法，魔力都是从自己这里往外涌，对吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-earthShrineOpening-11237": "ALEXANDRA: 这里却像反过来了，所有土系魔法都在倒流。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-earthShrineOpening-11238": "NIKOLAI: 流向哪里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-earthShrineOpening-11239": "ALEXANDRA: 不知道，就在我们下面，很深的地方。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-earthShrineOpening-11240": "CORDELIA: 难道这里就是地之圣祠？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-earthShrineOpening-11241": "BEN: 就是那种……用土系魔法的人聚在一起的地方？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-earthShrineOpening-11242": "CORDELIA: 理论上，它是世界上土系魔法的源头。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-earthShrineOpening-11243": "AGATA: 可已经一百多年没人能用这种魔法了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-earthShrineOpening-11244": "CORDELIA: 的确令人不安。可是……我几乎忍不住想亲眼看看，下面究竟有什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage1-11245": "从书里撕下的一页，样式古老，却被魔法保存了下来。标题是《米拉波伯爵日记》。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage1-11246": "“灾难刚发生后，我花了近一周，才从口袋空间中脱身。至少我感受到的是这么久。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage1-11247": "“村中的惨状说明，外界一定已过去数月。宅子成了废墟，仆人不知所踪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage1-11248": "“除了几个衣衫褴褛的拾荒者——全是陌生面孔——村中几乎没有活人的踪迹。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage1-11249": "“周围田里的庄稼，要么已经腐烂发黑，要么被搜刮得连根都不剩。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage1-11250": "“我的法术突然衰弱了。勉强施出的小法术，仍足以引来路上旅人的注意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage1-11251": "“他们苦苦哀求，让我恢复田地生机、治好热病[oxfordComma /]哪怕只分给他们一缕魔力！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage1-11252": "“可那一刻，我才发现自己的研究离日常生活何其遥远。我对最实用的魔法一无所知。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage1-11253": "“又何必去学呢？在那以前，它们本就如泥土般寻常。”",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage2-11254": "“直到抵达塞伦，我才明白，我们身处的噩梦究竟有多深。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage2-11255": "“城外路上挤满流民。旅店与农舍尽归地方豪强，他们……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage2-11256": "“……以刀枪逼人进贡。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage2-11257": "“为求安全，我只能睡在自己的口袋空间里，却又惹来不少麻烦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage2-11258": "“魔法门越来越难打开，居所与外界的时间差也越来越大。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage2-11259": "“我每过完一天、重返外界，就发现外面已经过了一周，后来是半个月，再后来竟是整整一季。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage2-11260": "“每次回来，世界都陷入更深的混乱与荒芜。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage2-11261": "“在塞伦城门口，我开始察觉极其微弱的残存魔力。可城里充斥着凶徒和相互争斗的帮派。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage2-11262": "“每片阴影都藏着危险。但在力量继续衰退、使我也落得与众人一样的境地之前，我必须继续前进，找到答案。”",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage3-11263": "“城里的博物馆、军械库[oxfordComma /]与王室宅邸，都被小头目占据。库房里仍有魔法的痕迹……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage3-11264": "“……可显然，只有我能感知，或许也只有我能利用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage3-11265": "“那些可怜人依旧盼着魔法归来。时日流逝，饥饿与暴力令他们越来越少。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage3-11266": "“如今我藏在一位法师遗弃的家中。究竟是谁的家，我说不上来。摆在明处的家当，大多已不见踪影。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage3-11267": "“他魔法密库里的法术书和器物刻着各种姓名，任何一个都可能属于他。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage3-11268": "“每过一天，我的魔法就更弱，可器物和固定附魔依然强大。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage3-11269": "“自古便拥有魔法的野生生物，也依旧如此。显然，魔法仍然存在，却正在远离人类。可究竟退向何方？”",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage4-11270": "“一次次实验印证了我的理论——仿佛亲眼所见还不够。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage4-11271": "“我对已故法师的器物施加失重术，它们便缓缓朝城西南偏西飘去，甚至逆风而行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage4-11272": "“有东西在吸引它们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage4-11273": "“循那个方向走了一周，我发现法术变强了。于是留在一座废村的残垣中，花一个月继续实验。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage4-11274": "“期间法术又开始减弱。这时我才明白，魔法——至少人类的魔法——正如退潮般撤去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage4-11275": "“接下来，我要勘查西南诸省，找出魔力流向之处。”",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage5-11276": "“原以为最难的，是说服当地领主开挖这片高原。我真愚蠢！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage5-11277": "“这里处处都是魔法的迹象，甚至太多了。每个小小奇迹，都诱使他们挖得更快、更深、更不顾一切。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage5-11278": "“漆黑的深处游荡着奇异凶残的生物。哪怕只短暂碰上一头，也可能夺去二十人的性命。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage5-11279": "“只要前面还有获得魔法的希望，大多数矿工就看不见危险。其余人则被监工的鞭子驱赶。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage5-11280": "“我梦见这些怪物。在狂热的幻梦中，它们用低沉隆隆的方言对我说话，我几乎能听懂。”",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage5-11281": "“它们在召唤我去某个地方，这点很清楚。我常从梦中醒来，才发现自己已穿戴整齐，正走在空旷的坑道里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage5-11282": "“我的魔法又开始消退。梦中的怪物以自己的方式告诉我，该如何保住天赋。深处有一个黑暗的许诺。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-ESPage5-11283": "“若我交出自己的一切，也许……”",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-earthShrineNoSubstance-11284": "看得见开关，可在星界里，它并无实体。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-earthShrineBackToFront-11285": "传送至迷宫入口？（随时可以传送回来。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-earthShrineBackToFront-11286": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-earthShrineBackToFront-11287": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-earthShrineFrontToBack-11288": "传送至祭坛房间？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-earthShrineFrontToBack-11289": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/earthShrine.yarn-earthShrineFrontToBack-11290": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/blockOnePush.yarn-blockOnePush_Init-11291": "按“\\[party\\]”重置",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/blockOnePush.yarn-blockOnePush_Push-11292": "按“\\[party\\]”重置"
}
